  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b7e8524b9cbba674da15165ed60ecb58, type: 3}
  m_Name: ThisPlaceNoteSO
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  noteTitle: This Place
  noteItemModel: {fileID: 3164688655149136121, guid: 8afb0c280bcbdca42bd4c61cbec40813,
    type: 3}
  notePages:
  - Everything in this place is alive. The walls move, the walls breath, the walls
    stare, waiting for <b>your</b> last breath.
  - I saw what this place does with the bodies. I refuse to be used as building blocks.
    <b>As mere meat.</b>
  - "I won\u2019t be able to escape this place, it doesn\u2019t matter if I do. They
    will just shoot me right between the eyes anyway."
  - Acid destroys the meat, makes it unusable. I will be released from this hell,
    and enter a new one. Not from God, not from this place, but from myself.
